  planner_response {
    response: "I have configured the Google Workspace integration and completed the **Resume Generation Pipeline** application:\n\n- **Google Workspace & Drive Integration**: Configured OAuth 2.0 with least-privilege scopes for Google Sheets and Google Drive (`spreadsheets` and `drive.file`), enabling the pipeline to read candidate records, upload compiled PDF resumes, and commit execution statuses back to your worksheets.\n- **7-Stage Visual Pipeline**: Implemented an automated stage tracker displaying real-time status across **01 FETCH**, **02 SHEET**, **03 GEMINI**, **04 LATEX**, **05 COMPILE**, **06 DRIVE**, and **07 COMMIT** with per-stage latency metrics and granular retry capabilities.\n- **Strict Anti-Hallucination AI Compiler**: Integrated server-side Gemini endpoints to analyze Job Descriptions and generate structured resume schemas grounded strictly in candidate source records without fabricating employers, degrees, dates, or metrics.\n- **Deterministic LaTeX & PDF Engine**: Built an ATS-compliant LaTeX compiler with character escaping and vector PDF generation, complete with interactive document previews, syntax-highlighted `.tex` source inspectors, and download options.\n- **Microphone Voice Input & Transcriber**: Added real-time voice recording with Gemini speech-to-text transcription to allow dictating Job Descriptions and candidate requirements directly via microphone.\n- **Live Runtime Console & Row Tracker**: Included a live event stream console with severity filters, export tools, and an interactive candidate table supporting single-row and batch runs."
    modified_response: "I have configured the Google Workspace integration and completed the **Resume Generation Pipeline** application:\n\n- **Google Workspace & Drive Integration**: Configured OAuth 2.0 with least-privilege scopes for Google Sheets and Google Drive (`spreadsheets` and `drive.file`), enabling the pipeline to read candidate records, upload compiled PDF resumes, and commit execution statuses back to your worksheets.\n- **7-Stage Visual Pipeline**: Implemented an automated stage tracker displaying real-time status across **01 FETCH**, **02 SHEET**, **03 GEMINI**, **04 LATEX**, **05 COMPILE**, **06 DRIVE**, and **07 COMMIT** with per-stage latency metrics and granular retry capabilities.\n- **Strict Anti-Hallucination AI Compiler**: Integrated server-side Gemini endpoints to analyze Job Descriptions and generate structured resume schemas grounded strictly in candidate source records without fabricating employers, degrees, dates, or metrics.\n- **Deterministic LaTeX & PDF Engine**: Built an ATS-compliant LaTeX compiler with character escaping and vector PDF generation, complete with interactive document previews, syntax-highlighted `.tex` source inspectors, and download options.\n- **Microphone Voice Input & Transcriber**: Added real-time voice recording with Gemini speech-to-text transcription to allow dictating Job Descriptions and candidate requirements directly via microphone.\n- **Live Runtime Console & Row Tracker**: Included a live event stream console with severity filters, export tools, and an interactive candidate table supporting single-row and batch runs."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
