    response: "I have fixed the issue causing the `auth/popup-closed-by-user` error:\n\n- **Graceful Popup Cancellation Handling**: Updated `oauthService.ts` and `App.tsx` to catch `auth/popup-closed-by-user` and `auth/cancelled-popup-request` when a user dismisses or closes the Google Sign-in window without completing authentication.\n- **Controlled Logging**: Prevented uncaught errors or red error alerts from triggering when the authentication dialog is closed, replacing it with clean status messages.\n- **Popup Blocking Safeguard**: Added clear guidance if a browser or iframe blocks popups, advising how to open the app or grant permissions."
    modified_response: "I have fixed the issue causing the `auth/popup-closed-by-user` error:\n\n- **Graceful Popup Cancellation Handling**: Updated `oauthService.ts` and `App.tsx` to catch `auth/popup-closed-by-user` and `auth/cancelled-popup-request` when a user dismisses or closes the Google Sign-in window without completing authentication.\n- **Controlled Logging**: Prevented uncaught errors or red error alerts from triggering when the authentication dialog is closed, replacing it with clean status messages.\n- **Popup Blocking Safeguard**: Added clear guidance if a browser or iframe blocks popups, advising how to open the app or grant permissions."
