  planner_response {
    response: "The error `auth/popup-closed-by-user` occurs for one of the following reasons:\n\n---\n\n### Why It Happened\n\n1. **The Popup Window Was Closed Early**:\n   * When you click **\"Connect Google Account\"**, a Google login window opens.\n   * If you closed the popup (by clicking the `X`, closing the tab, or clicking cancel) before selecting your account and accepting the Google Drive & Sheets permissions, the authentication is cancelled.\n\n2. **Iframe & Browser Sandbox Restrictions** *(Most Common in AI Studio Preview)*:\n   * Because the preview runs inside an **embedded iframe**, modern browsers (Chrome/Safari/Firefox) often block or immediately close third-party authentication popups and cookies for security.\n\n3. **Popup Blocker in Browser**:\n   * Your browser may have blocked the popup from completing the OAuth handshake.\n\n---\n\n### How to Make It Work\n\n1. **Open the App in a Full New Tab (Recommended)**:\n   * Click the **\"Open in New Tab\"** icon (in the top right corner of the preview header) or open the direct link:\n     [Open Direct App Preview](https://ais-dev-zpb346tbd45k7imxcrlrmz-883765664887.asia-southeast1.run.app)\n   * In a standalone browser tab, Google Sign-in popups and cookies are not restricted by iframe sandbox rules.\n\n2. **Allow Popups in Address Bar**:\n   * If your browser shows a **\"Pop-up blocked\"** icon in the address bar (on the right side of the URL bar), click it and select **\"Always allow pop-ups and redirects\"**.\n\n3. **Complete the OAuth Screen**:\n   * When the Google popup opens:\n     1. Choose your Google account (`shreyathakur9294@gmail.com`).\n     2. If prompted, check the permission boxes to allow access to Google Sheets & Google Drive.\n     3. Click **\"Continue\"** / **\"Allow\"**.\n     4. **Do not close the popup manually** \342\200\224 it will close itself automatically once authenticated.\n\n---\n\n*Note: If you are running the automation from your terminal with the Python script (`python scraper.py --candidate \"Lohith S\"`), it runs directly via your local credentials (`credentials.json`) without needing the web browser popup.*"
    thinking: "**Clarifying the Google Sign-in**\n\nI\'m focusing on why Google Sign-in might fail. Specifically, I\'m examining the scenario where the popup is closed by the user. I\'m noting that when the user clicks \"Connect Google Account,\" a Google OAuth popup is presented.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "The error `auth/popup-closed-by-user` occurs for one of the following reasons:\n\n---\n\n### Why It Happened\n\n1. **The Popup Window Was Closed Early**:\n   * When you click **\"Connect Google Account\"**, a Google login window opens.\n   * If you closed the popup (by clicking the `X`, closing the tab, or clicking cancel) before selecting your account and accepting the Google Drive & Sheets permissions, the authentication is cancelled.\n\n2. **Iframe & Browser Sandbox Restrictions** *(Most Common in AI Studio Preview)*:\n   * Because the preview runs inside an **embedded iframe**, modern browsers (Chrome/Safari/Firefox) often block or immediately close third-party authentication popups and cookies for security.\n\n3. **Popup Blocker in Browser**:\n   * Your browser may have blocked the popup from completing the OAuth handshake.\n\n---\n\n### How to Make It Work\n\n1. **Open the App in a Full New Tab (Recommended)**:\n   * Click the **\"Open in New Tab\"** icon (in the top right corner of the preview header) or open the direct link:\n     [Open Direct App Preview](https://ais-dev-zpb346tbd45k7imxcrlrmz-883765664887.asia-southeast1.run.app)\n   * In a standalone browser tab, Google Sign-in popups and cookies are not restricted by iframe sandbox rules.\n\n2. **Allow Popups in Address Bar**:\n   * If your browser shows a **\"Pop-up blocked\"** icon in the address bar (on the right side of the URL bar), click it and select **\"Always allow pop-ups and redirects\"**.\n\n3. **Complete the OAuth Screen**:\n   * When the Google popup opens:\n     1. Choose your Google account (`shreyathakur9294@gmail.com`).\n     2. If prompted, check the permission boxes to allow access to Google Sheets & Google Drive.\n     3. Click **\"Continue\"** / **\"Allow\"**.\n     4. **Do not close the popup manually** \342\200\224 it will close itself automatically once authenticated.\n\n---\n\n*Note: If you are running the automation from your terminal with the Python script (`python scraper.py --candidate \"Lohith S\"`), it runs directly via your local credentials (`credentials.json`) without needing the web browser popup.*"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 75532136
    }
