  planner_response {
    response: "**No, you do NOT have to publish the app for it to work.** \n\nThe development environment is already fully functional. Here is everything you need to know:\n\n---\n\n### 1. In the Web App (AI Studio Preview)\nYou do **not** need to publish or deploy to production. However, because Google OAuth popups are blocked by browser security inside an embedded iframe:\n* Simply **open the app in a new browser tab** using this direct link:  \n  \360\237\221\211 **[https://ais-dev-zpb346tbd45k7imxcrlrmz-883765664887.asia-southeast1.run.app](https://ais-dev-zpb346tbd45k7imxcrlrmz-883765664887.asia-southeast1.run.app)**\n* In a dedicated tab, the **\"Connect Google Account\"** popup will open smoothly, complete authentication, and connect directly to your Google Sheets and Google Drive.\n\n---\n\n### 2. In Python (Local Terminal / CLI)\nIf you are running the scrapers and resume generation via terminal commands:\n```bash\npython scraper.py --candidate \"Lohith S\" && python scraper.py --candidate \"Smit Patel\" && python scraper.py --candidate \"Vamsi Krishna\"\n```\n* **No publishing is required at all.**\n* The Python scripts run entirely on your local machine / environment, reading from `profiles.json` and writing directly to your Excel sheets and Google Drive.\n\n---\n\n### When would you need to publish?\nYou only need to publish or deploy if:\n- You want to share a permanent public URL with external team members who don\'t have access to your AI Studio workspace."
    modified_response: "**No, you do NOT have to publish the app for it to work.** \n\nThe development environment is already fully functional. Here is everything you need to know:\n\n---\n\n### 1. In the Web App (AI Studio Preview)\nYou do **not** need to publish or deploy to production. However, because Google OAuth popups are blocked by browser security inside an embedded iframe:\n* Simply **open the app in a new browser tab** using this direct link:  \n  \360\237\221\211 **[https://ais-dev-zpb346tbd45k7imxcrlrmz-883765664887.asia-southeast1.run.app](https://ais-dev-zpb346tbd45k7imxcrlrmz-883765664887.asia-southeast1.run.app)**\n* In a dedicated tab, the **\"Connect Google Account\"** popup will open smoothly, complete authentication, and connect directly to your Google Sheets and Google Drive.\n\n---\n\n### 2. In Python (Local Terminal / CLI)\nIf you are running the scrapers and resume generation via terminal commands:\n```bash\npython scraper.py --candidate \"Lohith S\" && python scraper.py --candidate \"Smit Patel\" && python scraper.py --candidate \"Vamsi Krishna\"\n```\n* **No publishing is required at all.**\n* The Python scripts run entirely on your local machine / environment, reading from `profiles.json` and writing directly to your Excel sheets and Google Drive.\n\n---\n\n### When would you need to publish?\nYou only need to publish or deploy if:\n- You want to share a permanent public URL with external team members who don\'t have access to your AI Studio workspace."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
