  planner_response {
    response: "Here is the exact file naming structure, folder paths, and Google Sheet column formats used for all three candidates:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Exact PDF File Names in Google Drive\n\nEvery compiled resume is saved using the strict **`<Candidate Name> <Experience Label> <Index>.pdf`** format:\n\n| Candidate | Experience Label | Example PDF Filename in Drive |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Lohith S** | `5EXP` | `Lohith S 5EXP 1.pdf`<br>`Lohith S 5EXP 2.pdf`<br>... up to `Lohith S 5EXP 75.pdf` |\n| **Smit Patel** | `5EXP` | `Smit Patel 5EXP 1.pdf`<br>`Smit Patel 5EXP 2.pdf`<br>... up to `Smit Patel 5EXP 75.pdf` |\n| **Vamsi Krishna** | `5EXP` | `Vamsi Krishna 5EXP 1.pdf`<br>`Vamsi Krishna 5EXP 2.pdf`<br>... up to `Vamsi Krishna 5EXP 75.pdf` |\n\n---\n\n### 2. Exact Folder Structure in Google Drive\n\nIn your Google Drive root or designated candidate folder, files are organized into **daily date subfolders** (`MM-DD-YYYY`):\n\n```text\n\360\237\223\201 Google Drive\n \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 \360\237\223\201 Lohith S /\n      \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 \360\237\223\201 08-23-2026 /\n           \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 \360\237\223\204 Lohith S 5EXP 1.pdf\n           \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 \360\237\223\204 Lohith S 5EXP 2.pdf\n           \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 ... (up to 75 files)\n \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 \360\237\223\201 Smit Patel /\n      \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 \360\237\223\201 08-23-2026 /\n           \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 \360\237\223\204 Smit Patel 5EXP 1.pdf\n           \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 ...\n \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 \360\237\223\201 Vamsi Krishna /\n      \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 \360\237\223\201 08-23-2026 /\n           \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 \360\237\223\204 Vamsi Krishna 5EXP 1.pdf\n           \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 ...\n```\n\n---\n\n### 3. Exact Tab & Column Format in Google Sheets\n\nIn your Google Sheet, entries are written to tabs named after the candidate (e.g., Tab: `Lohith S`, Tab: `Smit Patel`, Tab: `Vamsi Krishna`) with these 8 standard columns:\n\n| Col A: Date | Col B: Company | Col C: Job Title | Col D: Matched Role | Col E: ATS Portal | Col F: Resume File Name | Col G: Drive Link (Hyperlink) | Col H: Status |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `08/23/2026` | `Salesforce` | `Backend Engineer` | `Software Engineer` | `WORKDAY` | `Lohith S 5EXP 1.pdf` | `https://drive.google.com/file/d/...` | `Applied / Compiled` |\n| `08/23/2026` | `Stripe` | `Core Platform Engineer` | `Software Engineer` | `EASY_ATS (Greenhouse)` | `Lohith S 5EXP 2.pdf` | `https://drive.google.com/file/d/...` | `Applied / Compiled` |\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\222\241 Why You Might Not See Them in Your Google Account Yet\n\nIf you ran the pipeline in the web browser preview and don\'t see rows in your private Google Sheet or Drive yet:\n\n1. **Google Account Authorization in Standalone Tab**:\n   * The embedded iframe inside the editor blocks third-party Google OAuth writing cookies.\n   * Open the app directly in a full new tab:  \n     \360\237\221\211 **[https://ais-dev-zpb346tbd45k7imxcrlrmz-883765664887.asia-southeast1.run.app](https://ais-dev-zpb346tbd45k7imxcrlrmz-883765664887.asia-southeast1.run.app)**\n   * Click **\"Connect Google Account\"** in the top navigation and grant write access to Drive & Sheets.\n2. **If Running via Python Script**:\n   * If you run `python scraper.py --candidate \"Lohith S\"`, verify that your `credentials.json` or `service_account.json` has editor permissions on your Google Sheet and Google Drive target folders."
    modified_response: "Here is the exact file naming structure, folder paths, and Google Sheet column formats used for all three candidates:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Exact PDF File Names in Google Drive\n\nEvery compiled resume is saved using the strict **`<Candidate Name> <Experience Label> <Index>.pdf`** format:\n\n| Candidate | Experience Label | Example PDF Filename in Drive |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Lohith S** | `5EXP` | `Lohith S 5EXP 1.pdf`<br>`Lohith S 5EXP 2.pdf`<br>... up to `Lohith S 5EXP 75.pdf` |\n| **Smit Patel** | `5EXP` | `Smit Patel 5EXP 1.pdf`<br>`Smit Patel 5EXP 2.pdf`<br>... up to `Smit Patel 5EXP 75.pdf` |\n| **Vamsi Krishna** | `5EXP` | `Vamsi Krishna 5EXP 1.pdf`<br>`Vamsi Krishna 5EXP 2.pdf`<br>... up to `Vamsi Krishna 5EXP 75.pdf` |\n\n---\n\n### 2. Exact Folder Structure in Google Drive\n\nIn your Google Drive root or designated candidate folder, files are organized into **daily date subfolders** (`MM-DD-YYYY`):\n\n```text\n\360\237\223\201 Google Drive\n \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 \360\237\223\201 Lohith S /\n      \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 \360\237\223\201 08-23-2026 /\n           \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 \360\237\223\204 Lohith S 5EXP 1.pdf\n           \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 \360\237\223\204 Lohith S 5EXP 2.pdf\n           \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 ... (up to 75 files)\n \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 \360\237\223\201 Smit Patel /\n      \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 \360\237\223\201 08-23-2026 /\n           \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 \360\237\223\204 Smit Patel 5EXP 1.pdf\n           \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 ...\n \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 \360\237\223\201 Vamsi Krishna /\n      \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 \360\237\223\201 08-23-2026 /\n           \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 \360\237\223\204 Vamsi Krishna 5EXP 1.pdf\n           \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 ...\n```\n\n---\n\n### 3. Exact Tab & Column Format in Google Sheets\n\nIn your Google Sheet, entries are written to tabs named after the candidate (e.g., Tab: `Lohith S`, Tab: `Smit Patel`, Tab: `Vamsi Krishna`) with these 8 standard columns:\n\n| Col A: Date | Col B: Company | Col C: Job Title | Col D: Matched Role | Col E: ATS Portal | Col F: Resume File Name | Col G: Drive Link (Hyperlink) | Col H: Status |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `08/23/2026` | `Salesforce` | `Backend Engineer` | `Software Engineer` | `WORKDAY` | `Lohith S 5EXP 1.pdf` | `https://drive.google.com/file/d/...` | `Applied / Compiled` |\n| `08/23/2026` | `Stripe` | `Core Platform Engineer` | `Software Engineer` | `EASY_ATS (Greenhouse)` | `Lohith S 5EXP 2.pdf` | `https://drive.google.com/file/d/...` | `Applied / Compiled` |\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\222\241 Why You Might Not See Them in Your Google Account Yet\n\nIf you ran the pipeline in the web browser preview and don\'t see rows in your private Google Sheet or Drive yet:\n\n1. **Google Account Authorization in Standalone Tab**:\n   * The embedded iframe inside the editor blocks third-party Google OAuth writing cookies.\n   * Open the app directly in a full new tab:  \n     \360\237\221\211 **[https://ais-dev-zpb346tbd45k7imxcrlrmz-883765664887.asia-southeast1.run.app](https://ais-dev-zpb346tbd45k7imxcrlrmz-883765664887.asia-southeast1.run.app)**\n   * Click **\"Connect Google Account\"** in the top navigation and grant write access to Drive & Sheets.\n2. **If Running via Python Script**:\n   * If you run `python scraper.py --candidate \"Lohith S\"`, verify that your `credentials.json` or `service_account.json` has editor permissions on your Google Sheet and Google Drive target folders."
