  user_input {
    user_response: "Instead of saving the jobs and resumes into different drives and sheets, save them in\nshreya.thakur.9294@gmail.com drive and spreadsheet, but with different folders.\n\n- Save the resumes in the drive with the candidate\'s name and today\'s date.\n- Save in the folder; the folder should be named after the candidate. For example, if it\'s Smith, the folder should be Smith 24/8/2026.\n- For Vamshi, it should be Vamshi 24/8/2026.\n- For Lohith, it should be Lohith 24/8/2026 in the drive.\n- Save the resumes inside that folder. It should be the candidate\'s name with the file extension and the count. That is for the resumes which are to be saved in the drive.\n- Now coming to the spreadsheet. I want company, role, location, and job URL in the spreadsheet.\n- The sheet should be with the candidate name and today\'s date.\n- This is the saving part.\n- All three candidates\' data should be saved separately in the drive and sheet as well.\n- To the mail: shreyathakkar994@gmail.com, in its drive and spreadsheet.\n- Another thing which I want you to tell me is like suppose today\'s jobs, there is a code, there is a line in the code where today\'s job should not be repeated in the following days. Suppose there are 10 jobs which are given today. I don\'t want those jobs to be repeated the next day.\n- Is there any code in the sheet and tell me, and is it possible to save three candidates\' data in drive and sheet instead of different different mails?"
    items {
      text: "Instead of saving the jobs and resumes into different drives and sheets, save them in\nshreya.thakur.9294@gmail.com drive and spreadsheet, but with different folders.\n\n- Save the resumes in the drive with the candidate\'s name and today\'s date.\n- Save in the folder; the folder should be named after the candidate. For example, if it\'s Smith, the folder should be Smith 24/8/2026.\n- For Vamshi, it should be Vamshi 24/8/2026.\n- For Lohith, it should be Lohith 24/8/2026 in the drive.\n- Save the resumes inside that folder. It should be the candidate\'s name with the file extension and the count. That is for the resumes which are to be saved in the drive.\n- Now coming to the spreadsheet. I want company, role, location, and job URL in the spreadsheet.\n- The sheet should be with the candidate name and today\'s date.\n- This is the saving part.\n- All three candidates\' data should be saved separately in the drive and sheet as well.\n- To the mail: shreyathakkar994@gmail.com, in its drive and spreadsheet.\n- Another thing which I want you to tell me is like suppose today\'s jobs, there is a code, there is a line in the code where today\'s job should not be repeated in the following days. Suppose there are 10 jobs which are given today. I don\'t want those jobs to be repeated the next day.\n- Is there any code in the sheet and tell me, and is it possible to save three candidates\' data in drive and sheet instead of different different mails?"
    }
  }
