  planner_response {
    response: "### 1. Why Did the Google Drive Link Show \"File Does Not Exist\"?\n\nIn prototype/preview mode without an active Google authorization, the app generated simulated file URLs (like `DRIVE_SHREYA_LOHITH-S_1`). Because no file was physically uploaded to Google\'s servers yet, Google Drive returned *\"Sorry, the file you have requested does not exist.\"*\n\nTo upload the compiled PDF resumes directly into your real Google Drive folders (`Vamsi24-8`, `Lohith24-8`, `Smit24-8`) and create real, clickable Drive URLs, the app needs permission to access Google Drive and Google Sheets.\n\nI have initiated the **Google Workspace OAuth setup** for:\n- **Google Drive**: To upload each candidate\'s compiled PDF resumes (`Vamsi_Resume5exp1.pdf`, etc.) directly into your specified Google Drive folders with permission.\n- **Google Sheets**: To write and update the job application tracking rows directly into your spreadsheet tabs (`Vamsi Krishna (Dev) Dashboard`) with permission.\n\n> **Please accept the Google OAuth prompt displayed on your screen to authorize Google Drive and Google Sheets access.**\n\n---\n\n### 2. Job URLs & 12-Hour Posting Freshness\n\n- **Why some seed links showed closed/expired**: The built-in demonstration queue contained representative sample ATS links (Workday/Lever/Greenhouse patterns) which may not correspond to active listings today.\n- **Ensuring 100% Real-Time Jobs (< 12 Hours Old)**:\n  1. Once authorized, we can hook the job search service into live real-time job feeds (e.g., using live search querying or direct ATS feed scrapers filtered strictly by `posted_at: < 12 hours` / `last 24 hours`).\n  2. You can also paste or import any list of live job URLs, and the pipeline will parse them and generate the resumes with real links."
    modified_response: "### 1. Why Did the Google Drive Link Show \"File Does Not Exist\"?\n\nIn prototype/preview mode without an active Google authorization, the app generated simulated file URLs (like `DRIVE_SHREYA_LOHITH-S_1`). Because no file was physically uploaded to Google\'s servers yet, Google Drive returned *\"Sorry, the file you have requested does not exist.\"*\n\nTo upload the compiled PDF resumes directly into your real Google Drive folders (`Vamsi24-8`, `Lohith24-8`, `Smit24-8`) and create real, clickable Drive URLs, the app needs permission to access Google Drive and Google Sheets.\n\nI have initiated the **Google Workspace OAuth setup** for:\n- **Google Drive**: To upload each candidate\'s compiled PDF resumes (`Vamsi_Resume5exp1.pdf`, etc.) directly into your specified Google Drive folders with permission.\n- **Google Sheets**: To write and update the job application tracking rows directly into your spreadsheet tabs (`Vamsi Krishna (Dev) Dashboard`) with permission.\n\n> **Please accept the Google OAuth prompt displayed on your screen to authorize Google Drive and Google Sheets access.**\n\n---\n\n### 2. Job URLs & 12-Hour Posting Freshness\n\n- **Why some seed links showed closed/expired**: The built-in demonstration queue contained representative sample ATS links (Workday/Lever/Greenhouse patterns) which may not correspond to active listings today.\n- **Ensuring 100% Real-Time Jobs (< 12 Hours Old)**:\n  1. Once authorized, we can hook the job search service into live real-time job feeds (e.g., using live search querying or direct ATS feed scrapers filtered strictly by `posted_at: < 12 hours` / `last 24 hours`).\n  2. You can also paste or import any list of live job URLs, and the pipeline will parse them and generate the resumes with real links."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
