  planner_response {
    response: "### Google Workspace Authorization & Drive Sync Enabled\n\nGoogle Drive and Google Sheets OAuth integration is enabled for your project (`gen-lang-client-0511180722`).\n\n---\n\n### Key Updates\n\n1. **Direct Google Drive Uploads & Clickable Links**:\n   - Resolved simulated link 404 errors by adding live Google Drive API folder discovery and file creation.\n   - When processing jobs, resumes are compiled into vector PDFs and uploaded into your designated candidate daily folder (`Vamsi24-8`, `Lohith24-8`, `Smit24-8`).\n   - Generates real, shareable Drive URLs (`https://drive.google.com/file/d/<fileId>/view`) linking directly to the uploaded file.\n\n2. **Accurate PDF Naming & Folder Organization**:\n   - Folders follow the format: `Vamsi24-8`, `Lohith24-8`, `Smit24-8`.\n   - File names match the screenshot pattern: `Vamsi_Resume5exp1.pdf`, `Vamsi_Resume5exp2.pdf`, `Lohith_Resume5exp1.pdf`, `Smit_Resume5exp1.pdf`.\n\n3. **Master Google Sheet Output**:\n   - The **Master Sheet & Drive Output** modal formats all 320 entries with standard columns:\n     `Company` | `Role` | `Location` | `Job URL` | `Resume File Name` | `Google Drive Folder` | `Drive PDF Link` | `Candidate` | `Status`\n   - Use **\"Copy All for Google Sheets\"** or **\"Download CSV\"** to paste data directly into `Vamsi Krishna (Dev) Dashboard`.\n\n4. **Job Posting Freshness**:\n   - The search generator targets active tech companies across Workday and Easy Apply (Greenhouse, Lever) ATS portals for your specified candidate quotas.\n   - You can also paste live JD links into the search panel, and the pipeline will automatically process them.\n\n---\n\n### How to Run\n\n1. Open the app: **[https://ais-dev-zpb346tbd45k7imxcrlrmz-883765664887.asia-southeast1.run.app](https://ais-dev-zpb346tbd45k7imxcrlrmz-883765664887.asia-southeast1.run.app)**\n2. Click **\"Connect Google\"** in the top bar to sign in.\n3. Click **`\342\232\241 Complete All 3 Candidates (320 Resumes)`** to run the pipeline and sync files."
    modified_response: "### Google Workspace Authorization & Drive Sync Enabled\n\nGoogle Drive and Google Sheets OAuth integration is enabled for your project (`gen-lang-client-0511180722`).\n\n---\n\n### Key Updates\n\n1. **Direct Google Drive Uploads & Clickable Links**:\n   - Resolved simulated link 404 errors by adding live Google Drive API folder discovery and file creation.\n   - When processing jobs, resumes are compiled into vector PDFs and uploaded into your designated candidate daily folder (`Vamsi24-8`, `Lohith24-8`, `Smit24-8`).\n   - Generates real, shareable Drive URLs (`https://drive.google.com/file/d/<fileId>/view`) linking directly to the uploaded file.\n\n2. **Accurate PDF Naming & Folder Organization**:\n   - Folders follow the format: `Vamsi24-8`, `Lohith24-8`, `Smit24-8`.\n   - File names match the screenshot pattern: `Vamsi_Resume5exp1.pdf`, `Vamsi_Resume5exp2.pdf`, `Lohith_Resume5exp1.pdf`, `Smit_Resume5exp1.pdf`.\n\n3. **Master Google Sheet Output**:\n   - The **Master Sheet & Drive Output** modal formats all 320 entries with standard columns:\n     `Company` | `Role` | `Location` | `Job URL` | `Resume File Name` | `Google Drive Folder` | `Drive PDF Link` | `Candidate` | `Status`\n   - Use **\"Copy All for Google Sheets\"** or **\"Download CSV\"** to paste data directly into `Vamsi Krishna (Dev) Dashboard`.\n\n4. **Job Posting Freshness**:\n   - The search generator targets active tech companies across Workday and Easy Apply (Greenhouse, Lever) ATS portals for your specified candidate quotas.\n   - You can also paste live JD links into the search panel, and the pipeline will automatically process them.\n\n---\n\n### How to Run\n\n1. Open the app: **[https://ais-dev-zpb346tbd45k7imxcrlrmz-883765664887.asia-southeast1.run.app](https://ais-dev-zpb346tbd45k7imxcrlrmz-883765664887.asia-southeast1.run.app)**\n2. Click **\"Connect Google\"** in the top bar to sign in.\n3. Click **`\342\232\241 Complete All 3 Candidates (320 Resumes)`** to run the pipeline and sync files."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
